      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I do think it's better to use the total (public+private) count for the games list instead of just public count. I understand the appeal of pushing games with public lobbies to the top but some game worlds are better enjoyed in a friends+ and people looking for that sort of experience still still look in the games tab. Discoverability of games with a much higher private than public count is not good.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
